WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:04.118
Rat piled the weapons on the floor.

2
00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:07.798
Toad jumped around with his sword.

3
00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:12.058
"Take that, you weasel!" he cried.

4
00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:16.800
Rat gave swords to Badger and Mole.

5
00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:20.218
Rat handed out some more things.

6
00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:25.760
Badger laughed. "Do we really need rope?

7
00:00:25.761 --> 00:00:30.419
Do we need handcuffs and a lunch box?"

8
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.070
Rat looked at him in surprise.

9
00:00:34.071 --> 00:00:37.092
"I want to be prepared," he said.

10
00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:42.455
"All right, Ratty!" laughed Badger.

11
00:00:42.456 --> 00:00:46.184
Badger held a lantern in one hand.

12
00:00:46.185 --> 00:00:49.366
His club was in the other.

13
00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:53.384
"Now, follow me!" cried Badger.

14
00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:58.716
He led them to a hole in the riverbank.

15
00:00:58.717 --> 00:01:02.026
Badger disappeared into the tunnel.

16
00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:05.907
Mole and Rat dove in too.

17
00:01:05.908 --> 00:01:10.570
But Toad slipped and fell into the river.

18
00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:13.299
[i@Splash!@i]

19
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.914
"Help me!" screamed Toad.

20
00:01:16.915 --> 00:01:20.482
The friends came back.

21
00:01:20.483 --> 00:01:24.594
"What are you doing, Toad?" said Badger.

22
00:01:24.595 --> 00:01:29.352
He pulled Toad into the tunnel.

23
00:01:29.353 --> 00:01:33.134
The tunnel was dark and damp.

24
00:01:33.135 --> 00:01:37.519
"Don't make noise, Toad," said Rat quietly.

25
00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.527
"We'll leave you behind if you do."

26
00:01:40.528 --> 00:01:45.750
Rat hurried to join Badger and Mole.

27
00:01:45.751 --> 00:01:51.274
"It's cold in here," said Toad, trembling.

28
00:01:51.275 --> 00:01:55.370
"Come on, Toad," Rat called from ahead.

29
00:01:55.371 --> 00:01:59.860
Toad stepped carefully and looked around.

30
00:01:59.861 --> 00:02:06.428
Soon he was all alone in the dark.

